            en: "Problems 1–5 are mate in one, 6–10 mate in three. The kifu is carried over from the Infinite Wealth set (game8 and Altema cross-checked): Altema's Lost Judgment captures are zoomed crops, but the visible area — the king, the piece to move and its neighbours — matches the Infinite Wealth boards with no contradiction, and every Lost Judgment text source describes the same moves. Lost Judgment guides only describe the moves, and Altema, GameWith, Kamigame and AppMedia all describe this line for all ten. Diagrams are Altema's answer captures, with the finger on the piece to play.",
